Official music video for The Doobie Brothers - "What A Fool Believes" from the album 'Minute By Minute' (1979). "What A Fool Believes" reached #1 on the Billboard Hot 100 on April 14, 1979 - one of only a handful of non-disco songs to hit #1 in 1979.

